---

### Quick Checklist for Launch

- [ ] All core pages (Home, Category, Product, Cart, Checkout, Account) are built.
- [ ] Responsive design passes mobile & tablet tests.
- [ ] SEO meta tags & structured data added.
- [ ] Payment gateway integrated & tested in test mode.
- [ ] Recommendation API returns results.
- [ ] Unit & E2E tests pass locally.
- [ ] CI pipeline builds & deploys automatically.
- [ ] Analytics events fire correctly.
- [ ] Security audit (OWASP Top 10) completed.

---

**That’s it!**  
Follow this roadmap, adapt the tech choices to your team’s expertise, and you’ll have a robust, scalable, and delightful frontend for your e‑commerce business. Happy coding!
